<%= render "footer" %>
<%= @person.family.name %> has <%= @payment.outstanding.format %> due for <%= @event.title %> (<%= event_time_range(@event) %>).

<% @payment.line_items.each do |item| %>
- <%= item.person.full_name %>, <%= item.option.name %>: <%= item.cost.format %>
<% end %>
<% unless @payment.paid.zero? %>
- Already paid: -<%= @payment.paid.format %>
<% end %>

Pay from your Scout Account on the event page (your balance is <%= @person.family.balance.format %>):
<%= event_url(@event) %>
